{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14114050","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14114050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1411405001:0":{"text":"なんとか追い払えたな。たぶん、地震に驚いて飛び出してきたんだろう。","source_cn":"总算击退了，恐怕是被地震吓得跑出来的，这么没头没尾地乱撞。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF86D8A24643D8C06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1411405002:0":{"text":"みんな、大丈夫か？","source_cn":"各位，没什么事吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66B989F2632DD894","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1411405002":{"text":"みんな、大丈夫か？","source_cn":"各位，没什么事吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66B989F2632DD894","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1411405003:0":{"text":"地面や壁に亀裂は見当たりません、落石の影響もないようですね。","source_cn":"地面和墙壁也没有裂缝，碎石影响也不大。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E245BCE2A41BFB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1411405004:0":{"text":"それにしても、凄い揺れでしたね。中の作業員たちは大丈夫でしょうか？","source_cn":"只是刚刚摇晃得太厉害了，里头的矿工会不会有什么问题？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB50AF44227AD6706","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1411405005:0":{"text":"みんな経験豊富だから、ちゃんと避難してると思うけど、あまりにも突然だったからな……","source_cn":"这里的矿工经验丰富，应该知道怎么躲避，只是这地震也太突...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3A26F3915BB8E66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1411405006:0":{"text":"万が一がありますからね。僕も何か手伝えるかもしれません。","source_cn":"以防万一，我们赶紧进去看看吧，万一有事，我也好搭把手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD9055AF427C9618","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1411405007:0":{"text":"え、いやいや、アンタらに手伝ってもらうわけには……","source_cn":"这、这怎么行，你们是来商务考察的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE69F10436421A64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1411405008:0":{"text":"遠慮しないでください。あなたも、回りくどいやり取りは嫌いだと言ってたでしょう？","source_cn":"别浪费时间了，祖娅，你不是说过，讨厌那些弯弯绕绕的交涉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x851251A5D4A20CA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1411405009:0":{"text":"人手は多いに越したことはありません。今は人命が最優先です。行きましょう。","source_cn":"多个人多份力，救灾要及时，我们快走吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E641AA4736C74C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1411405010:0":{"text":"分かった。ありがとう、バハラムさん！","source